==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|fool|proof|lang=en}}.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# For a device: [[protected]], or [[designed]] to be [[proof]] against [[misuse]] or [[error]]; [[fail-safe]].
# For an idea or plan: [[infallible]], or [[bulletproof]].

